{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：部分段落的感受词密度偏高，少数意象抽象或连续堆叠，实际扫读时不如X轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用高亮把每段最重要的心理变化凸显出来，话与感受交替出现，也让音乐细节在对应时刻进入，观众更容易抓住人物每一步为什么靠近、犹豫、退缩又重新敞开。尤其是从第七段开始，人物对亲近的理解从希望被需要，逐渐变成即使不被需要也愿意陪伴，最后接受无法保证永远，这条心理变化在Y里保留得更完整、更细腻。X的左右分栏确实有快速扫读的优势，但部分心理转折和音乐细节被压缩了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "df2ef0d9-db4e-4b8e-a9a2-978cf986385f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T210137933918Z", "elapsed_seconds": 93.39, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:03:11.336080+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0fae58a86f5827f9dee93846c79a2da7b859bf38a3e3524d9e7189410cba03d8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":